<title>UK: BNP unit sets $350 million 10-year Yankee. [CORRECTED 16:04 GMT]</title>
<headline>BNP unit sets $350 million 10-year Yankee. [CORRECTED 16:04 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE NATIONALE DE PARIS, NEW YORK</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANQUE NATIONALE DE PARIS</p>
<p> AMT    $350 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    10-YEARS</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE	 JAN.97</p>
<p>(Corrects pay date from FEB.97)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD   +73 BP AREA</p>
